A frozen backbone's cached embeddings are no longer served to another configuration of the same model. The cache is shared by every `FrozenBackboneTransformer` in the process, and `Experiment` turns it on by default, but its key ignored the backend and `backend_kwargs`: a LaBraM with channel interpolation and one without, or two checkpoint revisions of one model, got the embeddings of whichever ran first. The key now holds them.
